            0.168,
            0.744,
            0.225
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Design and create simple models to represent particles of solids, liquids, and gases showing interparticle spacing using clay balls, beads, etc."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
